{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國演藝事務所「One Hundred」爆出財務問題後，旗下廠牌「INB100」的韓團EXO成員伯賢遭公司拖欠約10億韓圜（約580萬港元）結算金。</p><p>他與Chen及Xiumin所屬的EXO小分隊EXO-CBX向「INB100」提出的合約訴訟未</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:56.827014+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:57:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.893183+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.893183+00:00","content_hash":"1c51b42f23ebe35d4ef0e90fb3f670aefb4ac22efcc3067cbad8c8b079c8b98c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}